@@ -0,0 +1,44 @@
+# architecture
+
+glimpse has four main layers.
+
+## source loading
+
+the cli resolves whether the user wants unstaged changes, staged changes, a
+range, stdin, or a saved patch file. source loading should not know anything
+about opentui.
+
+## parser
+
+the parser converts unified diff text into an internal model. render code should
+never need to inspect raw patch lines.
+
+## state
+
+state tracks the active tab, scroll positions, mode, and transient messages.
+state transitions should be testable without a terminal.
+
+## render
+
+render converts state into opentui renderables. it should be able to redraw from
+scratch because layout depends on terminal size.
+
+## future work
+
+- fuzzy file picker
+- command palette
+- config file support
+- line wrapping
+- word-level change highlights
+- open in editor
